{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25382","headline":"奉和韦侍御陪相公游开义五言六韵 · 李德裕","name":"奉和韦侍御陪相公游开义五言六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羊公追胜概，兹地暂逍遥。\n风景同南岘，丹青见北朝。\n石渠清夏气，高树激鲜飙。\n念法珍禽集，闻轻醉象调。\n偶分甘露味，偏觉衆香饶。\n爲问毘城内，余薰几日销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}